<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Homemade Cake</title>

    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #fff7f8;
            color: #4a3035;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #f3a6b8;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 42px;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .content {
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 30px;
            background-color: white;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        h2 {
            color: #c64f70;
            text-align: center;
        }

        h3 {
            color: #b54463;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 17px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .highlight {
            background-color: #fff0f4;
            padding: 20px;
            border-left: 5px solid #f3a6b8;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin: 25px 0;
        }

        footer {
            background-color: #f3a6b8;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <h1>🎂 Homemade Cake</h1>
        <p>Sweetness Made With Love ❤️</p>
    </header>

    <div class="content">

        <h2>About Cake 🍰</h2>

        <p>
            Cake is one of the most loved desserts around the world.
            It can be made in many different flavors, shapes and sizes.
            Chocolate, vanilla, strawberry, red velvet and many other
            flavors make cake perfect for different occasions.
        </p>

        <h2>🏡 What Is Homemade Cake?</h2>

        <p>
            Homemade cake is a cake prepared at home using ingredients
            such as flour, eggs, sugar, butter or oil, milk and baking
            powder. Making cake at home allows us to choose our favorite
            flavors and decorations.
        </p>

        <div class="highlight">
            <h3>💕 Why We Love Homemade Cake</h3>

            <p>
                Homemade cakes are special because they are made with
                care and creativity. Baking at home can be a fun activity
                with family and friends, and sharing a freshly baked cake
                can make celebrations even more memorable.
            </p>
        </div>

        <h2>🎉 Perfect For Every Occasion</h2>

        <p>
            Homemade cakes are wonderful for birthdays, weddings,
            festivals, family gatherings and other celebrations.
            You can also bake a simple cake just to enjoy with a cup
            of tea or coffee.
        </p>

        <h2>🍓 Different Cake Flavors</h2>

        <p>
            There are many delicious cake flavors to try, including
            chocolate cake, vanilla cake, red velvet cake, lemon cake,
            mango cake, strawberry cake, coconut cake and coffee cake.
        </p>

        <h2>❤️ The Sweetest Part</h2>

        <p>
            The best thing about homemade cake is not only its taste,
            but also the happiness of making and sharing something
            special with the people we love.
        </p>

    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>🍰 Homemade with Love • Happy Baking! 💕</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
